  <link slot="head" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Reenie+Beanie&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <div class="okh"> <!-- HERO: video first --> <section class="khero"> <div class="w"> <div class="hero-grid"> <div class="stack"> <span class="kick">Video ad creative testing · UGC · for e-commerce & apps</span> <h1>We make video ads, test them and scale <span class="cap">the ones that sell</span></h1> <p class="lead">Research, scripts, 600+ vetted creators, native formats and a data loop after every batch. One team, end to end.</p> <div class="row"> <a class="btn" href="#offer">Order 10 videos · $500</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="https://calendly.com/okad_calls/first" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a call</a> </div> <p class="alt-link">Need a website or a brand? <a href="#design">Our design studio →</a></p> </div> <div class="collage" aria-label="Frames from our ads"> <span class="note hand hn">real frames from our ads <svg class="arr" width="54" height="48" viewBox="0 0 54 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6 C 26 0, 44 14, 46 40"/><path d="M38 33 L46 42 L51 31"/></svg></span> <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/cases/ai-app-designed/img-02.jpg" alt="Creator showing a before and after LinkedIn photo"></figure> <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/cases/ai-app-designed/img-06.jpg" alt="Good, better, best ranking ad"></figure> <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/cases/ai-app-designed/img-31.jpg" alt="Creator holding a handwritten sign"></figure> <a class="sticker" href="/cases/creative-testing-ai-app-meta-ads"> <b>160+</b> <span>video ads for one AI app in four months<small>Case 01 · read →</small></span> </a> </div> </div> <div class="strip"> <div><b>10,000+</b><span>ads & posts created</span></div> <div><b>600+</b><span>vetted creators of our own</span></div> <div><b>100+</b><span>brands we work with</span></div> <div><b>3–5</b><span>hook variations per ad</span></div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- LOGOS --> <section aria-label="Clients"> <div class="logos-cap"><span class="kick">Trusted by 100+ brands</span></div> <div class="logos"> <div class="lt"> <im